    "# Ensemble learning"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "8e9a4ba0",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "Ensemble learning in machine learning is a technique where multiple models are trained to solve the same problem, and their predictions are combined to improve the overall performance. The idea behind ensemble learning is that by combining the predictions of multiple models, you can often achieve better results than any single model on its own."
   ]
